-| 1M | SQLite | 0.577 s | 0.124 s | 0.700 s | 1,428,095 | 2.406 µs | 0.027 s |
-| 10M | EliteSQL | 7.207 s | 0.155 s | 7.363 s | 1,358,180 | 2.524 µs | 0.167 s |
-| 10M | SQLite | 5.855 s | 1.838 s | 7.693 s | 1,299,811 | 34.347 µs | 0.568 s |
