-| Query | Literal SQL | Bound values | Difference |
-|---|---:|---:|---:|
-| Unique-index point lookup | 4.061 µs | 3.447 µs | -15.1% |
-| Indexed join, ~100 matching orders, top 10 | 155.58 µs | 153.05 µs | -1.6% |
